OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ADrugs at their fingertips, intense
OL,4,Apressure: Why child stars fall into
OL,5,Aaddiction
OL,6,
OL,7,F"Within minutes, a wave of energy
OL,8,Fwashed over me, like I'd just woken up
OL,9,Ffrom the most refreshing night's sleep
OL,10,Fof my life," Panettiere wrote about
OL,11,Fthat pill in her memoir, which was
OL,12,Freleased just months before her death.
OL,14,FShe called it "the gateway drug that
OL,15,Fushered me toward the good of
OL,16,Fpharmaceuticals and the downfall of
OL,17,Faddiction".
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/18
